'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[medium armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

== Acquisition ==
Both the [[body armor]] and [[helmet]] can be claimed from page 1 of the [[Entrenched Division Premium Warbond|Entrenched Division]] Premium [[Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|45|notext}} and 35 [[Medal]]s, respectively.

== Passive Ability ==
{{Armor Passive Info Panel|Concussive Padding, Grenadier}}

== Trivia ==
The Sapper's helmet resembles a variety of real-life WWI-era helmet designs, such as the British [[wp:Brodie_helmet|Brodie helmet]].

